                                "sense_id": "95768ebd-423c-358e-be0c-6f878c50c236",
                                "text": "[Timmy] offered her his bag of Doritos."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "000806b0-272d-42f1-adcf-e254be9ba0e3",
                                "sense_id": "95768ebd-423c-358e-be0c-6f878c50c236",
                                "text": "I looked out the kitchen window at my garden, my trenches, my dirt, and then my gaze turned downward toward my Dorito-stained hand."
                            },
